<Component BF998R>
  <Description>
BF998R N-Channel Dual-Gate Depletion MOSFET (Philips/NXP)
Reverse-pinout variant of BF998. SOT-143R package.
VDS=12V ID=30mA Ptot=200mW NF~0.6dB@800MHz
Same electrical model as BF998; package pin order is reversed.
Pins: 1=S(Source) 2=D(Drain) 3=G2(AGC/Gate2) 4=G1(RF/Gate1)
  </Description>
  <Model>
.Def:DualGateMOSFET_BF998R _net0 _net1 _net2 _net3
Sub:X1 _net0 _net1 _net2 _net3 gnd Type="BF998R_cir"
.Def:End
  </Model>
  <Spice>
* BF998R - electrically identical to BF998, reversed package
.SUBCKT BF998R_cir gnd _net0 _net1 _net2 _net3
X1 _net0 _net1 _net2 _net3 nBF998
.ENDS
  </Spice>
